 "title": {
  "de": "Gespräch: Einkaufen",
  "en": "Conversation: shopping"
 },
 "intro": {
  "de": "Verkäufer fragen oft, was du suchst, und nennen den Preis. Mit 너무 비싸요 und 깎아 주세요 kannst du auf dem Markt handeln.\nGeld zählt man mit 원: 만 원 = 10.000 Won.",
  "en": "Shop staff often ask what you're looking for and tell you the price. With 너무 비싸요 and 깎아 주세요 you can haggle at the market.\nMoney is counted in 원: 만 원 = 10,000 won."
 },
 "exercises": [
  "dialog-reply"
 ],
 "check": {
  "questions": 8
 },
